&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Environment variables&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;environment-variables&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#environment-variables&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Packer has a few environment variables :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PACKER_LOG : enable Packer detailed logs (off by default)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PACKER_LOG_PATH : set the path of Packer logs to specific file (rather than stderr)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PKR_VAR_xxx : define a variable value using ENV rather than in a template&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

